Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.48,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,PACHINKO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.77,0:00:06.23,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Could we stop meeting here? It's loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:09.01,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I don't even like pachinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:13.50,main,CEO,0,0,0,,We're meeting here because you didn't \Nwant me to come to your guild hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.28,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:19.40,main,CEO,0,0,0,,You haven't forgotten \Nour promise, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:28.17,top,SIGN BIG,0,0,0,,WE KILL PEOPLE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:35.56,main,MOM,0,0,0,,Welcome home! I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:36.67,main,BROTHERS,0,0,0,,Mirabel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:38.26,main,BROTHERS,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:44.02,top,SIGN BIG,0,0,0,,WE KILL PEOPLE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.97,0:01:00.58,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE LAID-OFF CHEAT-GRANTING MAGE\NENJOYS A SECOND LEASE ON LIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.69,0:02:19.07,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I'm glad we all made it back to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.51,0:02:21.65,main,REIN,0,0,0,,What are you doing after this, Margaret?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:25.43,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Once I pick up my dog from \Nthe pet hotel, I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:28.68,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You should come hang out at the \NBlue Crystals guild hall sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:30.17,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Heck, you should join the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:33.71,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.50,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You could come with us right—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:39.69,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I-I really need to go to \Nthe pet hotel! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:41.51,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You could just stop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:43.89,top,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,DASH
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:43.89,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,My dog! My dog is waiting for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:45.89,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Well, come as soon as \Nyou've picked up your dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:46.77,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You look like a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.79,top,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,DASH
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.79,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,My dog would get your guild hall dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:52.49,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Nobody would care. \NThe place is already filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.49,0:02:53.02,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:57.12,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,But my dog... My dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:03:00.48,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Margaret!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:04.66,top,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,I'VE NEVER BEEN TO THAT BAKERY BEFORE, SO I'LL\NTAKE THIS OPPORTUNITY TO STUFF MY FACE WITH\NMELON BREAD AND WALK A DOG, WAHOO.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:07.81,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,PET LIFE PUYO
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:14.41,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I didn't plan to make friends with \Nanyone, but they invited me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.89,0:03:21.20,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I've never \Ncalled you by your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:25.55,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Sh-Shall we go home, Acorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:29.31,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Quit it, Acorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.69,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I am not my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:35.90,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,The moment I spoke formally, \Nit created distance between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:39.77,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,C'mon, Acorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:43.66,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE BEAST'S FANG
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:43.66,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,I have important news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:47.05,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,I'm canceling the plan \Nthat Glenda initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.05,0:03:49.40,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,We'll apologize to Rein \Nand ask him to return—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:50.16,main,HALF,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.47,0:03:55.30,main,HALF,0,0,0,,Barrius, you put my friends on that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:58.85,main,HALF,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think \Nyou're doing, baldy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:03:59.30,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:01.30,main,HALF,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, baldy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:01.30,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:04.30,main,HALF,0,0,0,,Your head's as smooth as \Na bowling ball, baldy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:08.17,main,HALF,0,0,0,,You think we won't kill you \Nbecause you're the guildmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:10.43,main,HALF,0,0,0,,Do you really want to test us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:16.46,main,HALF,0,0,0,,Coward. Can't even respond, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:18.45,main,COMRADE A,0,0,0,,Later, Barrius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:21.38,main,COMRADE B,0,0,0,,Don't get too much hair on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:23.29,main,COMRADE B,0,0,0,,This isn't a salon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:28.04,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:32.64,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,I didn't think kicking out one idiot \Nwould cause this much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:33.33,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:37.71,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE EMPEROR'S SHIELDS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.11,0:04:36.69,main,GUILD MEMBER,0,0,0,,Emperor's Shields guild precepts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:40.96,main,ALL,0,0,0,,We live to go on adventures!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:43.97,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Being able to adventure is a blessing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:45.97,main,ALL,0,0,0,,We are grateful for adventures!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:49.85,main,ALL,0,0,0,,Clearing the path to \Nadventures is the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:54.17,main,CEO,0,0,0,,Louder, Margaret. I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:58.09,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,CEO, I am reciting the guild precepts \Nmore passionately than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:04:59.86,main,CEO,0,0,0,,Call me "Guildmaster."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:02.48,main,CEO,0,0,0,,Then recite the next precept by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:05.99,top,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:05.99,main,CEO,0,0,0,,I knew it! You're just mouthing the words!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:10.49,top,SIGN TOP,0,0,0,,ADVENTURE QUOTA
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:10.49,top,SIGN LEFT TO RIGHT,0,0,0,,HONDA SAKAI YAMADA (NEW)\NMARGARET ELLS KINOSHITA SUZUKI KATAYAMA
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:10.49,main,CEO,0,0,0,,Margaret, people like you bring \Nthe whole organization down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.24,top,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.24,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:13.25,main,CEO,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:15.23,top,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,FLAP FLAP FLAP
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.09,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I'm not mocking you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.55,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm mocking you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:18.00,main,CEO,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:21.13,main,CEO,0,0,0,,If you're going to do that, don't use \Nyour hands to say you're not mocking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:23.48,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right! Thank you \Nfor the instruction, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:25.26,main,CEO,0,0,0,,I'm not here to teach you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:27.26,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,GUILDMASTER'S OFFICE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:30.42,main,CEO,0,0,0,,I heard you used your paid leave to \Ngo somewhere with the Blue Crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:32.89,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Guam is nice. It's close, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:36.92,main,CEO,0,0,0,,I bet you're thinking about \Njoining the Blue Crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:40.03,main,CEO,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, Margaret Ells...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:42.56,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,What's unfortunate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:46.93,main,CEO,0,0,0,,That guild is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:52.97,main,REIN,0,0,0,,There's nobody here. \NI wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:56.13,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Elsie, Nina!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.39,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:00.14,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:03.05,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I was in the area while walking my dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:04.44,main,LILY,0,0,0,,How cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:07.22,main,REIN,0,0,0,,He's even cuter than the \Nlast time we saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.66,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,My sister loved this dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.66,0:06:11.68,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I decided to stop speaking \Nformally to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:14.30,main,REIN,0,0,0,,So that's why you've \Nconnected with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.61,main,LILY,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:23.49,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Y-You're Barrius!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.94,0:06:27.19,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Rein, I'm here because \NI have business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:29.37,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Wh-What business could \Nyou have with me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:32.57,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Looks like I'd just get \Nin the way. I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.57,0:06:36.03,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Why? You don't have to leave, Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:38.46,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:42.96,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Please come back to the Beast's Fangs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:48.18,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,At this rate, our guild \Nwill cease to exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:54.14,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,We need your powers as a \Nskilled enchanter to rebuild!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:57.54,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,That guild is everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:07:01.65,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,I'd even give my life for the guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:04.73,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,So please come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:06.73,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Then why did you kick me out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:15.74,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,I was bitching to a friend at a bar, \Nand it just kind of happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:19.20,main,REIN,0,0,0,,"It just kind of happened"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:22.09,main,REIN,0,0,0,,What does that even mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:24.14,main,REIN,0,0,0,,That's not a real reason! \NIt doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:26.38,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Well, I can't help that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:31.77,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Lily, Margaret! You've thought about \Nkicking Rein out, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:34.64,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,You know how annoying he can be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:36.92,main,REIN,0,0,0,,What are you even saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:38.70,main,REIN,0,0,0,,They've obviously never thought that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.29,0:07:49.51,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I-I'm not sure what you're \Ntrying to say, Barrius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:52.28,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Neither am I. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:55.65,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.65,0:07:57.43,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Looking at him doesn't \Nsend you into a rage?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:07:59.17,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,You don't want to beat him to a pulp?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:02.54,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I've never been enraged in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:06.97,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I want to beat all of humanity \Nto a pulp except for Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:11.01,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,He was tolerable at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:15.30,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,but you got sicker of him \Nwith each passing day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:20.69,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I-I didn't hear the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:24.07,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was thinking \Nabout something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:30.19,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Come on, guys! This is an \Nimportant conversation! Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:32.69,top,SIGN FX BLUE,0,0,0,,SQUEEZE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:30.75,top,SIGN FX RED,0,0,0,,WHAM
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:31.00,top,SIGN FX YELLOW,0,0,0,,POW
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:31.30,top,SIGN FX YELLOW,0,0,0,,POW
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:31.51,top,SIGN FX YELLOW,0,0,0,,POW
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:31.88,top,SIGN FX RED,0,0,0,,WHAM
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:32.69,top,SIGN FX YELLOW,0,0,0,,POW POW POW POW POW POW POW POW
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:35.70,main,LILY,0,0,0,,We're reacting this way \Nbecause we were listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:38.95,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,We don't have to focus to \Nknow what he's talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:45.31,top,SIGN FX RED,0,0,0,,WHEEZE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.73,0:08:46.19,top,SIGN FX RED,0,0,0,,WHEEZE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:47.19,top,SIGN BLUE,0,0,0,,BARRI...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:48.21,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Barri... Barriu... Ba...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:51.13,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I'm not going back to the Beast's Fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:54.22,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I'm staying with the \NBlue Crystals forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:58.47,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I have fun with these guys, \Nand they're good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:01.57,main,REIN,0,0,0,,We help and support each \Nother when we need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.57,0:09:04.73,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I want to stay here and be \Nthat kind of adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:07.15,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Wait, Rein! The Beast's Fangs—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:09.36,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Give it up, Barrius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:12.12,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You might say the laid-off \Ncheat-granting mage
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:16.07,main,LILY,0,0,0,,is enjoying a second lease on life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:28.63,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE LAID-OFF CHEAT-GRANTING MAGE ENJOYS A SECOND LEASE ON LIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:16.74,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:28.63,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an5}I CAN GRANT BONUS POINTS TO ANY OBJECT, NOT JUST WEAPONS, AND I CAN DISPEL THAT EFFECT AT WILL, BUT ARE YOUR REMAINING MEMBERS OKAY?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:21.22,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I can grant bonus points to \Nany object, not just weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:25.72,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,and I can dispel that effect at will, \Nbut are your remaining members okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.72,0:09:27.73,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,That's what Rein's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:28.63,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:30.72,main,REIN,0,0,0,,What the hell? I never said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:38.01,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.11,0:09:43.45,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Rein found a nice place and \Nfriends he gets along with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:48.89,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind. \NI'm disbanding the Beast's Fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.89,0:09:51.52,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Rein, sorry for kicking you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:55.53,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Got it. It's water under the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:09:58.49,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,See you later, Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:01.42,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Take good care of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:07.21,flashback,CEO,0,0,0,,That guild's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:10.63,flashback,CEO,0,0,0,,They're drowning in debt. \NThey'll go out of business soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:13.88,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Are you happy, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:15.96,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Why are {\i1}you{\i0} happy, Acorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:18.57,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Um, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:23.88,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I heard the Blue Crystals are drowning \Nin debt and will go out of business soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:26.14,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:27.64,main,LILY,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:29.56,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.12,0:10:31.31,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,So they're hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:35.31,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:31.31,top,REIN,0,0,0,,Why is the guild in debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:32.24,top,LILY,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.79,top,REIN,0,0,0,,How much does the guild owe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:34.82,top,LILY,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.06,top,REIN,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:37.32,top,LILY,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:38.90,top,REIN,0,0,0,,Why is the guild in debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:39.87,top,LILY,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:41.07,top,REIN,0,0,0,,How much does the guild owe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.07,top,LILY,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:39.87,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,I'm not one of them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:43.26,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Acorn, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:45.08,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:48.21,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,If you don't listen to me, \NI'll speak formally to you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:54.97,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Stop by again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:56.54,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You're always welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:58.97,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I will. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:12.48,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Debt? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:14.78,main,NINA,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:16.61,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I knew it wasn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:20.13,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,That's what you were worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:23.08,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Anyway, you defeated \Nthe Radiant Dragon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:26.49,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,You'll get an adventurer \Nrank promotion for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:29.97,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Ow, it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:31.69,main,LILY,0,0,0,,That's the Radiant Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:33.13,main,NINA,0,0,0,,What? That?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:37.63,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:39.97,main,LILY,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:45.24,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I was working for 980 yen \Nan hour before I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:48.01,main,REIN,0,0,0,,The work was worthwhile, \Nbut they kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:51.77,main,REIN,0,0,0,,But I got to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:56.29,main,REIN,0,0,0,,If I hadn't, I wouldn't \Nhave made these friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:59.47,main,REIN,0,0,0,,and I wouldn't have gone on an adventure \Nto defeat the Radiant Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:02.24,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:04.28,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Should I keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:05.91,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:11.01,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Well, first of all, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:12.77,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,You ran out of things to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:19.55,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Elsie, Nina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:23.88,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Let me thank you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:29.61,main,LILY,0,0,0,,If not for you two, I think \NI would've quit adventuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.66,0:12:34.51,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Thank you for supporting me until \NI could get back on my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:37.26,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad you didn't quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:40.51,main,NINA,0,0,0,,We're glad you made a comeback, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:41.93,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:44.14,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Hey, what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.14,0:12:47.32,main,LILY,0,0,0,,This is why you suck, Rein!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:51.05,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Anyway, I think I'm starting to get bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.05,0:12:53.33,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Bored of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:59.33,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,It's a hassle, and frankly, I don't \Ncare about other people's adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.49,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.95,0:13:05.84,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I'm not a very good \Nguildmaster for saying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:10.85,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,This guild is finished. I'm disbanding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:11.63,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:12.18,main,NINA,0,0,0,,Dis...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:14.85,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Disbanded? Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:18.86,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,The Blue Crystals adventurer's \Nguild is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:22.11,main,NINA,0,0,0,,But Master, what about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:24.61,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,You can join another guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:28.12,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,There are plenty of way better ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.49,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Just join one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:34.42,main,LILY,0,0,0,,H-How could you say that \Nabout your own guild?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:35.77,main,LILY,0,0,0,,What are you even saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:38.15,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:43.17,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily, where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.07,0:13:53.05,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.05,0:13:54.89,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:57.72,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Are you joining the Blue Crystals?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:59.40,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:02.57,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,They don't think of me as one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:05.07,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,They don't answer my questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:09.57,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Being friendly with someone isn't \Nenough to be part of their group.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:13.27,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened, \Nbut I'm not sure that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:19.09,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,It could just be a minor misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:21.70,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Conflicts between people usually are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:26.25,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're not actually scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:30.13,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,They might reject you \Nif you ask to join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.27,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,They might not welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:37.33,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Life's easier when you run \Naway and don't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:40.63,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,But we still have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:45.44,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,I say that, but I was clinging \Nto the Beast's Fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:50.81,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,You need to join the Blue Crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:55.78,main,BARRIUS,0,0,0,,Good luck. You have my support.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:08.21,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily, I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:11.20,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:21.73,main,REIN,0,0,0,,H-Hey, how long are we going to stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:24.00,main,LILY,0,0,0,,If you're bored, you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:34.26,top,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,SNIFFLE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.34,0:15:41.37,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily, I bought some bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:50.05,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Wow, you ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:51.19,main,LILY,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:54.39,main,MIA,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Are you adventurers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:16:00.89,main,MIA,0,0,0,,I'm Mia, the guildmaster of the \NSpirit's Bow adventurer's guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:04.65,main,MIA,0,0,0,,Would you like to join my guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:09.15,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE SPIRIT'S BOW
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:09.15,main,MIA,0,0,0,,This is the Spirit's Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:11.40,top,SIGN GREEN,0,0,0,,THE SPIRIT'S BOW
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:11.40,top,SIGN BROWN,0,0,0,,DRINK BAR
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:13.41,main,LILY,0,0,0,,It's so nice and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:15.03,top,SIGN TOP,0,0,0,,SO MANY FUN CHOICES!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:15.03,top,SIGN BLUE,0,0,0,,WATER
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:14.59,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:19.79,top,SIGN GREEN,0,0,0,,THE SPIRIT'S BOW
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:19.79,top,SIGN BROWN,0,0,0,,DRINK BAR
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:18.95,main,MIA,0,0,0,,We pride ourselves on providing \Nservices as good as any other guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:19.79,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:25.53,main,MIA,0,0,0,,Naturally, we have a member's \Nlounge and drink bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:26.29,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:29.17,main,MIA,0,0,0,,Our gym has every kind of machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.17,0:16:30.05,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:32.05,top,SIGN FX RED,0,0,0,,STEP STEP STEP STEP STEP STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:32.05,top,SIGN FX BLUE,0,0,0,,PANT PANT PANT PANT
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:32.05,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:33.32,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:38.21,main,MIA,0,0,0,,We have everything an adventurer \Ncould need, such as shower rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:39.81,top,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,ZSHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:36.87,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:39.81,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:43.18,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.49,0:16:50.49,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Rein, I thought this would \Ndistract me, but it didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:57.34,main,LILY,0,0,0,,What if Elsie considered me a nuisance?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:17:01.01,main,LILY,0,0,0,,What did she really think of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:03.70,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Was it my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:12.64,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I can't help but think those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:19.68,main,REIN,0,0,0,,We should talk to Elsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.22,0:17:26.48,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE SPIRIT'S BOW
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.57,0:17:26.48,main,MIA,0,0,0,,What did you think of the Spirit's \NBow's facilities and services?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:29.25,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Well, they're certainly impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:33.74,main,MIA,0,0,0,,Great. We'd be honored to have an \Nadventurer like you approve of—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:37.49,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Elsie had you bring us here, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.73,0:17:41.56,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Elsie? Why bring her up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:44.00,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I thought so from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:46.25,main,MIA,0,0,0,,Please don't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.51,0:17:50.75,main,MIA,0,0,0,,She once did me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:55.20,main,MIA,0,0,0,,She begged me over and over \Nto look after you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:02.01,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Oh, did she spill the beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:03.89,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Elsie...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.09,0:18:11.79,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,You'd blame yourself if you knew this \Nguild was closing because of debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:18.64,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I didn't want to burden you with anything \Nelse, so I tried to play the scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.53,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You just gave me more to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.77,0:18:25.29,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,You're right. I'm sorry. I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:30.03,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:38.42,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I trained for three years \Nunder a veteran adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:40.43,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Six years after I went my own way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:44.65,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I became famous and was enjoying \Nthe life of an S-rank adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:46.60,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,That's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:52.00,flashback,MOB ADVENTURER,0,0,0,,I heard your master was \Nbadly injured by a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:56.44,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I took time off to go see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:59.71,flashback,MASTER,0,0,0,,Is that you, Elsie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.81,0:19:04.20,flashback,MASTER,0,0,0,,Haven't seen you in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.10,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,M-Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:13.21,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ODEN
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:21.05,flashback,MASTER,0,0,0,,I got infected when the dragon bit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:22.59,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.91,0:19:31.56,flashback,MASTER,0,0,0,,Society sees sick and injured \Nadventurers as used-up trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:38.69,flashback,MASTER,0,0,0,,I wasn't particularly unlucky.\NThis is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:43.82,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,No, it's not! This isn't normal at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.52,0:19:50.68,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Adventurers are considered expendable. \NI wanted to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:54.98,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,That's why I formed the Blue Crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:58.31,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Disheartened adventurers could come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:20:01.72,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,and I'd help them get back on their feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.61,0:20:06.47,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,The Blue Crystals was where \NI'd make my dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.99,0:20:08.56,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,At least, it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.64,0:20:14.69,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,We've been in the red \Nthese past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:17.36,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I exhausted my savings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:21.40,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,The Blue Crystals are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:24.38,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,But over 20 people got \Nback on their feet there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.63,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,It wasn't pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.63,0:20:28.89,flashback,CEO,0,0,0,,Y-You should keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:31.12,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I can't. I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:32.25,flashback,CEO,0,0,0,,I'll lend you 500 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:35.30,flashback,CEO,0,0,0,,You can pay me back in four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:37.88,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,What if I can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:42.01,flashback,CEO,0,0,0,,Then you can be an adventurer \Nat my guild again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:43.62,flashback,CEO,0,0,0,,We'll call it your signing bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:46.67,flashback,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Are you sure? That's all \Nyou want for 500 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:47.67,flashback,CEO,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.67,0:20:52.27,flashback,CEO,0,0,0,,It's a low price to pay \Nfor Elsie the adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:57.09,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,In three months, I'll have to \Ngo join the Emperor's Shields,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.47,0:21:00.28,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,so the Blue Crystals are finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:03.22,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I wanted to change the \Nworld of adventuring,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:05.02,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,but I failed to change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:08.17,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,It's all my fault, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.53,0:21:10.29,main,LILY,0,0,0,,That's not your decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:15.40,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You helped me back on my feet \Nwhen I was disheartened!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:18.42,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You saved plenty of \Nother adventurers, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:22.75,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who \Ncan help disheartened people!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:27.54,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I can help you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:30.83,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,Lily...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:36.84,main,ELSIE,0,0,0,,I'm not much of a guildmaster if \NI need an adventurer to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:37.82,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:43.95,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You created a good guild for others, \Nand you lied to protect Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:49.57,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You're a guildmaster because you're \Nalways thinking about adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:53.08,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I like the Blue Crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:56.08,main,NINA,0,0,0,,I'll stay here until the end, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:22:00.64,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I... The adventurers \Nof the Blue Crystals...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.71,0:22:04.09,main,LILY,0,0,0,,will earn 500 million in three months!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:49.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:54.51,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SHE SAID REIN!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:22:59.52,top,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3}TRANSLATION: SHO STIFLER\NTIMING: ANDY ELLIS
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:04.98,top,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1}EDITING: ALICIA ASHBY\NQUALITY CONTROL: WILLIAM HAGGARD
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:09.74,top,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3}FINAL QUALITY CONTROL: BECKY COTTRILL
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:54.51,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,IS SHE...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:54.51,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,TALKING ABOUT MEEE?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:23:04.98,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ROLEPLAYING LIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:15.74,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:26.13,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4}REIN CRASHES THE STAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:18.75,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,YOU WERE TALKING ABOUT ME, RIGHT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:18.75,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.75,0:23:19.50,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,RIGHT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:20.25,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:21.00,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:21.75,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.75,0:23:22.50,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:23.25,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.25,0:23:24.00,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:24.75,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,YOU WERE, RIGHT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.75,0:23:25.50,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:26.13,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:30.63,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ROLEPLAYING LIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:28.80,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:29.55,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:30.30,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:30.63,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:40.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,RUSH
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:40.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7}LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:40.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an9}LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:40.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an5}THE BLUE CRYSTALS CRASH THE STAGE!

